      "writtenOn": "2017-05-08T04:51:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "AAA app is for implementing the 802.1x authenticator function and its responsibility is to talk EAPoL towards the supplicant and Radius towards the Radius server. It is not good practice to build ethernet frame as part of this app (violates the layering). If there is indeed a need for resolving the endpoint, it needs to be done as a separate app which is responsible for just resolving end-points. \n\nIt is also not clear why socket option does not suffice for your case.",
      "revId": "c74cbc43011bf331e3260357cf4236f4346eae74",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
